# --- Windows 新建文件家族（中文/英文系统"右键新建"的默认命名冲突格式）---
# 防范：工作区出现"?? 新建 文本文档 (2).txt"这类噪音 → 误 commit → Linux runner 编码/括号解析失败
新建 文本文档*.txt
新建 位图图片*.bmp
新建 Microsoft Excel 工作表*.xlsx
新建 Microsoft PowerPoint 演示文稿*.pptx
新建 Microsoft Word 文档*.docx
新建 压缩(zipped)文件夹*.zip
New Text Document*.txt
New Bitmap Image*.bmp
New Microsoft Excel Worksheet*.xlsx
New Microsoft PowerPoint Presentation*.pptx
New Microsoft Word Document*.docx
Compressed (zipped) Folder*.zip

# --- Logs / temp ---
*.log
tmp/
temp/

# --- Local runtime data / screen recordings / scratch scripts (never commit) ---
.local/
backend/.local/
frontend/.local/
*.mp4
*.mov
_tmp_*.py
_tmp_expand_dict.py

# --- E2E / debug artifacts (may contain session tokens) ---
